 BOD. I focus mostly on EU too. Looking forward to your analysis. This is how I see GU. Broke demand. Demand below looks CP'd. What do you think?\n\nMy picture looks largely the same as yours. The D at around.5950 ish is uncompressed so that will be a bounce there (providing we make it.... god i hope so ). Under that is CP'd fo' sho'. The way it's falling i see lots of DBD on the way down which should provide us with lots of ideas how to play the bounces as and when they come.\n\nBut i think it will go even lower than that eventually... lets see how this weeks candle ends up....who knows, we could end up with a D1 bull pin right now (tho i seriously doubt that) so lets roll with the punches.\n\nFor now the fight for 1.6 continues.....the doors have been smashed in but there are plenty of defenders in there!","a":"beebolbod","d":"","n":"#693","p":28,"im":["f1c88e0ae6245010e3c7c5f068a8064806dd430b"],"m":693},{"id":"supplydemand_p28_694","t":"Okay here is something of interest in nzd just happened to look at the chart D area base of a pole some history.\n\n4hr looks like a swap zone next 4hr D is a ways down so htf compression of sorts.\n\n5min demand engulfed coming back to a capped area and I think you cant see the origin of this runup.\n\nAgain I am not advising you jump right in, this is an analyis that took me 2 min 17 secs, could be major flaws. You make youre own choices as Alvin told me ahaha\n\nAs for correlations, AU at htf supply working the same kind of thing & just printed 4hr engulfing on my feed and Loonie is playing around in Daily D flagging.","a":"fxfury","d":"","n":"#694","p":28,"im":["475c5ca7ead59f15aae971e4fb4a1e48e87cd7d1","ea7eb2bfeadb5f059e990f9d20a7b364ed19f6b7","f659cfd0cdb75ed97709e2af7b08c343a1fc413b"],"m":694},{"id":"supplydemand_p28_695","t":"Hello all:\n\nI'm seeing GBDUSD breaking a supply line at the conflunce of a trend line. I think this might be a move toward 1.5830. Does anyone else see this?","a":"Rippin","d":"","n":"#695","p":28,